# twin: render_one
# vulkan/one with a core that sets a version 1 context negotiation
# interface: its create_device makes the device on the physical device the
# harness chose, with nothing required, and the harness destroys it after
# the core's destroy_device.
console 0 core=test render=vulkan
option 0 link_test_render vulkan
option 0 link_test_vk_negotiate v1
30 checkpoint early
60 save mid
60 checkpoint mid
120 end
